# Everything the build does not need. Keeping node_modules out matters most:
# the image installs its own, and copying a host tree in would both bloat the
# context and risk shipping binaries built for the wrong platform.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.storage-test
apps/mobile/dist
docs
*.md
!README.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.deploy.example
